ter kicker. So risky.  \n\nGiven that, maybe check-calling a small bet is better, but they might not bet if weak. Checking risks giving free showdown to a better Ace.  \nI'll go with small bet representing the flush.  \n\n---\n\n**Answer:** 400"}
